WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.904
-The House voted today to rein
in the president's war powers

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.941
as it becomes increasingly clear
the Trump administration lied

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.042
to justify an unconstitutional
act of war.

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:11.978
For more on this, it's time for
"A Closer Look."

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.180
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:19.285
Amid lingering tensions
and unanswered questions

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.086
from a crisis he started
with Iran,

00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:23.422
as well as an impending
impeachment trial in the Senate,

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:26.192
