at the White House today,

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.927
and decided to whine
about the fact

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.029
that no one gives him credit
for giving up

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.430
his presidential salary.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.566
Trump tried to say that
he donates the money

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:36.169
to good causes, like fighting
the opioid epidemic,

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.371
but it didn't quite come out
the right way.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.972
-I spent a lot
of my own money.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:41.908
And I always ask the question,
I said,

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:43.543
