was necessary."

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.178
Because I don't think
anybody even knew

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.512
that I was spending it.

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:48.314
I mention it every once in
a while, but I don't know.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:49.916
For instance,
I give up my salary.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.019
It's $450,000,
approximately $450,000,

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.487
the presidential salary.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.921
